From d8a320798c61fadf998858b309f28f6850e206f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TAKANO Mitsuhiro <takano32@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 11:17:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: defconfig: Drop four symbols that no longer exist

arch/arm64/configs/defconfig still lists four symbols that no Kconfig
file defines any more, so `make defconfig` ignores those lines, and
only warns about them if KCONFIG_WARN_UNKNOWN_SYMBOLS is set:

  CONFIG_NFS_V4_1                  merged into CONFIG_NFS_V4 (7537db24806f)
  CONFIG_SLIM_QCOM_CTRL            driver removed (7cbba32a2d62)
  CONFIG_NET_VENDOR_PACKET_ENGINES vendor directory removed (aec3202247b4)
  CONFIG_SCHED_DEBUG               option removed (b52173065e0a)

Three of these lines went stale when their symbols were removed.  The
Ethernet line is different: commit 32379ad4060b ("arm64: defconfig:
Drop unused Ethernet vendors") added it after the vendor directory had
already been removed, so the line was stale the day it landed.

None of the four can appear in a regenerated .config, so dropping the
lines removes dead text and changes nothing else.

Three of the four lines have been posted before and are still in the
tree: CONFIG_SCHED_DEBUG twice in 2025 [1][2], CONFIG_SLIM_QCOM_CTRL in
December 2025 [3], and CONFIG_NFS_V4_1 as patch 3/9 of a treewide
configs cleanup [4].  They went to the SoC maintainers and were
reviewed, but none of them was applied.  This patch puts the four arm64
lines in one commit and adds the Ethernet line, which no earlier post
covered.

Nothing was built: the four symbols were confirmed absent by looking
for a "config" entry with each name in Kconfig.  The patch and this
changelog were written with an LLM assistant (Hermes Agent); the
checks above were run by the submitter.

Link: https://lore.kernel.org/20250828103828.33255-1-twoerner@gmail.com
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/20250911144714.2774539-1-mikko.rapeli@linaro.org
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/20251223140645.3545658-1-mikko.rapeli@linaro.org
Link: https://lore.kernel.org/20260317-arm_defconf_cleanup-v1-0-8eecb7fdd24d@kernel.org
---
 arch/arm64/configs/defconfig | 4 ----
 1 file changed, 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
index 7b4985b29b21..513f8d6be073 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/defconfig
@@ -424,7 +424,6 @@ CONFIG_MLX5_CORE_EN=y
 # CONFIG_NET_VENDOR_NETRONOME is not set
 # CONFIG_NET_VENDOR_NVIDIA is not set
 # CONFIG_NET_VENDOR_OKI is not set
-# CONFIG_NET_VENDOR_PACKET_ENGINES is not set
 # CONFIG_NET_VENDOR_QLOGIC is not set
 # CONFIG_NET_VENDOR_BROCADE is not set
 CONFIG_QCOM_EMAC=m
@@ -1756,7 +1755,6 @@ CONFIG_QCOMTEE=m
 CONFIG_MUX_GPIO=m
 CONFIG_MUX_MMIO=y
 CONFIG_SLIMBUS=m
-CONFIG_SLIM_QCOM_CTRL=m
 CONFIG_SLIM_QCOM_NGD_CTRL=m
 CONFIG_INTERCONNECT=y
 CONFIG_INTERCONNECT_IMX=y
@@ -1824,7 +1822,6 @@ CONFIG_SQUASHFS=y
 CONFIG_PSTORE_RAM=m
 CONFIG_NFS_FS=y
 CONFIG_NFS_V4=y
-CONFIG_NFS_V4_1=y
 CONFIG_NFS_V4_2=y
 CONFIG_ROOT_NFS=y
 CONFIG_9P_FS=m
@@ -1861,7 +1858,6 @@ CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO_DWARF_TOOLCHAIN_DEFAULT=y
 CONFIG_DEBUG_INFO_REDUCED=y
 CONFIG_MAGIC_SYSRQ=y
 CONFIG_DEBUG_FS=y
-# CONFIG_SCHED_DEBUG is not set
 # CONFIG_DEBUG_PREEMPT is not set
 # CONFIG_FTRACE is not set
 CONFIG_CORESIGHT=m

